{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udcbc <i>From Lab Rat to Kingpin</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're not just playing the game. You <i>are</i> the game.<br>Start with nothing\u2014an empty room, a burner phone, and a head full of ambition. Cook your first batch, sell on the streets, and claw your way up the criminal food chain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647010/extras/lab.gif?t=1744131526\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\uddea <i>Legal? Illegal? Doesn\u2019t Matter.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make clean meds or dirty drugs. Design your own chemical recipes using a deep crafting system. Create high-demand designer substances or flood the market with cheap junk\u2014what you cook is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647010/extras/lab2.gif?t=1744131526\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\udd1d <i>Solo Hustler or Co-op Cartel</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play alone, or build an empire with your crew in seamless 2\u20134 player online co-op. Share labs, split profits\u2014or double-cross them when it\u2019s time to take it all.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd2b <i>Run the Streets. Rule the City.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand your operation, hire dealers, set up fronts, and take over neighborhoods. Launder your money through clubs, clinics, or crooked businesses. But be warned: the bigger you get, the more heat you\u2019ll attract.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\ude94 <i>Stay Ahead or Go Down Hard</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Corrupt cops, rival gangs, snitches, and undercover agents\u2014everyone wants a piece. Manage your heat, cover your tracks, and always have an escape plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647010/extras/Police.png?t=1744131526\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd25 <i>Your Empire. Your Rules.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No hand-holding. No fake choices. You decide how far you\u2019ll go\u2014and what kind of kingpin you want to be. Build, betray, cook, kill, and conquer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The streets don\u2019t forgive. The empire won\u2019t build itself.</strong><br><br><strong>Time to rise.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3647010?t=1744131526","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3647010?t=1744131526","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647010/35213f0d2472b5e04c9a106c3044eeecab744563/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744131526","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647010/35213f0d2472b5e04c9a106c3044eeecab744563/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744131526","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62},{"description":"Steam Timeline","id":63}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udcbc <i>From Lab Rat to Kingpin</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're not just playing the game. You <i>are</i> the game.<br>Start with nothing\u2014an empty room, a burner phone, and a head full of ambition. Cook your first batch, sell on the streets, and cl